From: Oliphaunt Maintainers <dev@oliphaunt.dev>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] postmaster: supply the sealed executor and build closure

Add the product-specific compiler/executor, memory profile and startup proof,
plus CLI/workspace dependency integration. These implement Oliphaunt sealed
carrier policy rather than an upstream Wasmer feature. Keep them last so the
full source tree includes the engine and WASIX foundations they consume;
Cargo locks and feature selections remain pinned.

Extracted without runtime hunk changes from the inherited integration bundle.
The complete ordered series is the build and qualification unit.

